.TH CREATE-SHIFT-BLOCKS 1 "2026-08-31" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler v1.0.0" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler"
.SH NAME
create_shift_blocks.py \- interactively create a shift-block CSV
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python scripts/create_shift_blocks.py
[\fB\-o\fR \fICSV\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Terminal predecessor of the web Shift Setup page. Prompts for a schedule name,
date range, weekly blocks (name plus days of week), and shifts per day (name,
start, stop), then writes a scheduler-compatible block CSV. Shares its
date/slug logic with the web generator via
.IR scheduler/blocks.py .
For most uses prefer the web page at
.IR /admin/shift\-setup ,
which also supports daily/2-week/monthly repetition and per-shift weights.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-o " CSV"
Output path (default \fIsample_data/<schedule>_shift_blocks.csv\fR).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2e-shift-scheduler (1)
